@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@session = 替换为网页登录令牌

### 创建凭证：完整 token 仅本次返回，默认 90 天
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp/credential/create
Authorization: Bearer {{session}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"本地智能体","tools":["search","ask","list_knowledge_bases"]}

### 查看本人凭证，不返回 token 或 tokenHash
GET {{baseUrl}}/mcp/credential/list
Authorization: Bearer {{session}}

### 更新工具开关，下一次 MCP 调用即时生效
PUT {{baseUrl}}/mcp/credential/update-tools
Authorization: Bearer {{session}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":1,"tools":["search"]}

### 撤销本人凭证
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp/credential/revoke?id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{session}}
